        "jsCode": "// TRACK2-06 Data Cleaner & UUID Injector\nconst itinerary = $node[\"OpenAI GPT-4o (Strict Schema)\"].json.choices[0].message.content;\nconst flights = $node[\"Flight Orchestrator\"].json.data;\n// ... injection logic ...\nreturn [{ json: { itinerary_data: JSON.parse(itinerary), flight_data: flights } }];"
